# Golden runtime: `nx-wow64-dynarec-131`

Worktree `mrkvka-refactored-funicular`, branch `mrkvka-improve-game-runtime`. Tag `golden/nx-wow64-dynarec-131`. User confirmed pad and this screen path. Treat this as the baseline; do not "improve" it without an explicit new request.

## Pad — frozen, do not edit

Do not change DirectInput joystick mapping, XInput, `wine_nx_pointer_poll` stick/touch math, keys.txt overlay, or dinput/xinput headers.

- DirectInput enumerating a joystick must **not** zero pad keys. Only XInput (`gamepad`) zeros keys and takes the whole pad.
- DirectInput must not steal the keyboard overlay.
- No 256-key `WineNxAsyncInput` poll.
- Do not zero pad keys on `wine_nx_dinput_last_poll`.

## Screen — frozen, do not edit unless asked

- Advertise **640×480** current mode and **800×600** optional. Do **not** advertise 720p as a Win32 mode.
- Physical NWindow stays **1280×720**. GL origin is bottom-left.
- `SW_SHOWNORMAL`. Do not maximize `WS_POPUP` to 1280×720. Overlapped maximize uses `SM_CXSCREEN`/`SM_CYSCREEN` (the virtual 640×480 mode), not hardcoded 1280×720.
- `needs_framebuffer_surface()` is always **TRUE** on `__SWITCH__`. Keep `needs_framebuffer_surface` true so fshack FBO+`blit_framebuffer_surface` runs.
- Blit dest is **0,0,1280,720** (anamorphic stretch is OK). Do not blit only to the client rect.
- Do **not** also stretch inside `nx_drawable_swap` (double-stretch).
- GDI compositor: stretch quads when the bounding box is ≥320×240 and smaller than the screen (`src_width`/`src_height` on quads).
- Mouse: scale stick/touch from 1280×720 onto the foreground client.

## Build / deploy

Dynarec NRO ~18 MB (`wine-nx-probe/build-switch/wine-nx-runtime.nro`), never interpreter ~11 MB. Docker mount this tree as `/project`. FTP `192.168.1.34:5000` admin/admin, atomic replace `/switch/wine/wine-nx-runtime.nro`. Golden binary copy: `wine-nx-runtime.nro.golden-dynarec-131`. Log: `[BUILD] nx-wow64-dynarec-131` and `[NXGFX] stretch OpenGL client -> 1280x720`.
